---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact Us — txttoimage | Feedback, Support & Feature Requests"
  description="Contact the txttoimage team for support, feedback, bug reports, or feature requests. We read every message and respond within 24 hours. Free client-side text to image converter."
  path="/contact"
>
  <section class="min-h-[50dvh] flex flex-col pt-28 pb-12">
    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full px-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-emerald-600 font-medium mb-3"><a href="/" class="hover:underline">txttoimage</a> &rsaquo; Contact</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 leading-[1.15]">Contact Us</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Have questions, feedback, or feature suggestions? We would love to hear from you. We read every message and aim to respond within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">Get in Touch</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">For the fastest resolution, please check these resources before reaching out:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-zinc-500 list-disc ml-5">
          <li><a href="/how-it-works/" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">How It Works guide</a> — detailed instructions and troubleshooting</li>
          <li><a href="/#faq" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">FAQ section</a> — answers to the most common questions</li>
          <li><a href="/compare/" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">Tool comparison</a> — how txttoimage compares to alternatives</li>
          <li><a href="/api/" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">API & Automation</a> — integration with Puppeteer, Playwright, node-canvas</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-8 p-5 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm">Email Us</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-medium text-zinc-800">hello@txt-to-image.com</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-400">We aim to respond within 24 hours. All emails are read by a human.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm">🐛 Report a Bug</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">Include your browser name and version, what you were trying to do, and what happened instead. Screenshots help a lot.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm">💡 Suggest a Feature</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">Describe the feature and the problem it solves. We prioritize features that benefit the most users.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm">🔐 Security Concern</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">If you found a security vulnerability, please email us with details. We take security seriously and respond quickly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm">📣 General Feedback</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">We appreciate hearing what works well and what does not. Your feedback directly shapes the tool's development.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-zinc-100">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-zinc-500">Common questions about contacting txttoimage and getting help.</p>

      <dl class="mt-8 space-y-1">
        <details class="group bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl">
          <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer font-medium text-zinc-900 text-sm flex items-center justify-between">How quickly will I get a response? <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform ml-2 shrink-0" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-4 text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">We aim to respond to all emails within 24 hours on business days. Bug reports and security concerns are prioritized.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="group bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl">
          <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer font-medium text-zinc-900 text-sm flex items-center justify-between">Do you offer phone or live chat support? <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform ml-2 shrink-0" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-4 text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">Currently we provide email support only. This allows us to keep the tool completely free and ad-free. Email support ensures we can give each inquiry proper attention and maintain a written record for follow-up.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="group bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl">
          <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer font-medium text-zinc-900 text-sm flex items-center justify-between">Is my email address kept private? <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform ml-2 shrink-0" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-4 text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">Absolutely. We never share, sell, or use your email address for any purpose other than responding to your inquiry. We do not send marketing emails or newsletters. See our <a href="/privacy/" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a> for details.</div>
        </details>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Related Pages</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/how-it-works/" class="text-sm text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-full px-4 py-2 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">How It Works</a>
        <a href="/#faq" class="text-sm text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-full px-4 py-2 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/about/" class="text-sm text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-full px-4 py-2 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">About</a>
        <a href="/privacy/" class="text-sm text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-full px-4 py-2 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/" class="text-sm text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-full px-4 py-2 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
